---
// About: the person writing to you. The portrait is floated so the opening
// paragraph wraps around it at both breakpoints, as in the V2 artboards.
---
<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="lp-shell">
    <div class="sec-grid">
      <div class="sec-rail">
        <p class="lp-eyebrow">About</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sec-body">
        <div class="about-copy" data-reveal>
          <img
            class="portrait"
            src="/assets/hayri-portrait.jpg"
            alt="Hayri Demirçapa, founder and architect of Laterna+Partners."
            width="240"
            height="300"
            loading="lazy"
          />

          <h2 class="lp-h2 about-name">Hayri Demirçapa</h2>
          <p class="about-role">Founder &amp; Architect</p>

          <p class="about-p">
            I am an architect by training, based in South West London. Most developers look at
            land and see what could be quickly built and sold. I tend to look at it the way an
            architect does: what could be designed there, who it could serve, what the right
            thing for this piece of ground might be.
          </p>
          <p class="about-p">
            I trained and qualified as an architect in Istanbul. In London I went on to manage
            the whole design process of residential projects worth £40m to £100m, which is where
            I learned to read a site properly before deciding what to do with it.
          </p>
          <p class="about-p">
            An application that respects its surroundings tends to get through the council's
            planning committee more easily than one that does not. For you, that matters
            directly. Planning permission is what turns my offer into money in your hands, not a
            promise on paper.
          </p>
          <p class="about-p">
            I keep the practice small on purpose. Every letter, every appraisal and every
            conversation runs through me, not a call centre or a case handler. The cost of the
            planning work is carried on my side, never yours.
          </p>

        </div>

        <figure class="about-sketch" data-reveal>
          <img
            class="lp-sketch"
            src="/assets/sketches/about-house-garden.webp"
            width="1400"
            height="933"
            alt="A house and its long garden seen from above, with a new single-storey home at the far end picked out in blue, and two small plans showing the garden before and after."
            loading="lazy"
          />
          <figcaption class="lp-caption">
            A house, its garden, and the home that could be designed at the end of it. Illustrative.
          </figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about {
    padding: 64px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--lp-rule);
  }

  /* Eyebrow rail on the left from 1024, stacked below it. */
  .sec-grid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 24px; }
  .sec-body { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 32px; min-width: 0; }

  .about-copy::after { content: ""; display: table; clear: both; }

  .portrait {
    float: left;
    width: 160px;
    height: 200px;
    object-fit: cover;
    filter: grayscale(1);
    background: var(--lp-paper-soft);
    margin: 0 16px 8px 0;
  }

  .about-name { margin: 0; }
  .about-role {
    font-size: 15px;
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--lp-mute-text);
    margin: 4px 0 0;
  }
  .about-p {
    font-size: 17px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--lp-ink);
    margin: 16px 0 0;
    text-wrap: pretty;
  }

  /* 12px above and below keeps these links a 44px target. */

  .about-sketch { margin: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; }
  .about-sketch .lp-sketch { width: 100%; height: auto; }
  .about-sketch figcaption { margin: 0; }

  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .about { padding: 96px 0; }
    .about-p { font-size: 18px; margin-top: 20px; }
    .portrait { width: 240px; height: 300px; margin: 0 32px 16px 0; }
    .about-sketch .lp-sketch { width: 600px; max-width: 100%; }
  }

  @media (min-width: 1024px) {
    .about { padding: 128px 0; border-top: 0; }
    .sec-grid { flex-direction: row; align-items: flex-start; gap: 32px; }
    .sec-rail { flex: 0 0 200px; }
    .sec-body { flex: 1 1 auto; gap: 64px; }
    .about-copy { max-width: 72ch; }
  }
</style>
